:"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787438054900753001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"315c5821-20bf-4314-8c81-ec8641f3a2ab","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"9c72-c44a-3421-45ad"}],"description":"## Origin\nExtracted from decision register twofaced-paralytic-elk (9c72-c44a-3421-45ad), which is being dissolved into per-item tickets. Source bug: afflicted-hexed-arthropods (5b32-37c4-f99a-4315, closed) — code-review config gates enablement, not enforcement.\n\n## Decision required (verbatim from the register)\nChoose code-review invocation/enforcement semantics. Recommended compatible contract: explicit CLI/library/MCP `review-code` always runs by sending `enabled=True`; retain `verify.enable_code_review` only as the default for direct/internal verdict production; keep the Gerrit adapter explicit override because deployed receiver activation is already its enforcement control. Alternative: introduce a true `enforce_code_review` key, wire Gerrit voting to it, and coordinate repository plus deployed receiver configuration atomically so the currently-live LLM-Review gate is not silently disabled.\n\n## Status\nAwaits an operator design ruling; held at `idea` until ruled.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"ea71dd82-cc6c-470e-a694-08fcc9239535","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"idea","tags":["decision-register","debug-sweep"],"ticket_id":"7da9-4139-4c7f-4db2","ticket_type":"task","title":"Design ruling: code-review in